    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The mimics are on the loose - find and catch them! Explore interactive handcrafted 3D dioramas and solve environmental puzzles in order to reveal the hidden mimics.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395420/extras/401e1101bf15997878731f127f3ac22a.avif?t=1739726797\" data-has-big width=800 height=304 /></span><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pesky but adorable mimics are imitating all kinds of things - if you spot one, grab it!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Handcrafted scenes that are brimming with detail. Rotate and explore 3D dioramas to investigate every nook and cranny.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your wits to poke, move, collect and combine objects in order to reveal the mimics and their hiding places.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A responsive environment with high quality interactions and animations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Awesome music! Enjoy the beat while you search.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A quirky storyline with plenty of puns.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395420/extras/b6a1b0d6a983d3decda2ff0bffcb8bef.avif?t=1739726797\" width=128 height=128 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The mimics are on the loose - find and catch them! Explore interactive handcrafted 3D dioramas and solve environmental puzzles in order to reveal the hidden mimics.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395420/extras/401e1101bf15997878731f127f3ac22a.avif?t=1739726797\" data-has-big width=800 height=304 /></span><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pesky but adorable mimics are imitating all kinds of things - if you spot one, grab it!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Handcrafted scenes that are brimming with detail. Rotate and explore 3D dioramas to investigate every nook and cranny.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your wits to poke, move, collect and combine objects in order to reveal the mimics and their hiding places.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A responsive environment with high quality interactions and animations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Awesome music! Enjoy the beat while you search.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A quirky storyline with plenty of puns.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395420/extras/b6a1b0d6a983d3decda2ff0bffcb8bef.avif?t=1739726797\" width=128 height=128 /></span></p>",
